{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LYjbDTDcW2FearsLqTYLLD","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **advbench_llm_cp_annotation** (killed): —\\\\n- **advbench_llm_cp_full** (killed): —\\\\n- **qwen3_cp_dryrun** (killed): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 27 / 负向 20 / 失败 1 / 共 55\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-15904: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- advbench_r1_8b_full: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- advbench_llm_cp_annotation: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- advbench_llm_cp_full: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen3_cp_dryrun: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen3_cp_dryrun2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen3_cp_full: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- gpt4omini-cp-annotation: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- advbench_phase4_layer_sweep: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 630, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G4PSKXze5MbgEAhKHoT355","session_id":"eb7c9f09-21ff-4986-ae2c-11140cc85a3d","uuid":"c4fd506d-8a4e-4e9a-9b74-1d14b9f8544e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:10:38.041Z"}
